# Architecture

`docs/plan.md` is the contract. Read it before changing infrastructure or bootstrap code.

- Region is `us-east-1`.
- Stacks depend in one direction only: Network, Data, App, Orchestration, Monitoring. Data does not import App. Monitoring only reads earlier stacks.
- Stage comes from `infra/config.dev.yaml` or `infra/config.prod.yaml`. Resource ids and names go through `stagified` in `infra/utils/index.ts`.
- Open WebUI stays the official image. Do not set Redis or Tika variables.
- Plain settings are environment variables. Credentials are Secrets Manager injections in `us-east-1`.
